(SYNTHETIC MARKET REPORT \(sample data - not for real use\)) Tj
T* (Global Electric Vehicle Adoption 2019-2024) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Executive summary) Tj
T* (Battery-electric vehicle \(BEV\) sales grew from roughly 2.1 million units in) Tj
T* (2019 to an estimated 9.5 million units in 2024, driven by China and Europe.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Key findings) Tj
T* (- China accounts for the largest single-market volume across the period.) Tj
T* (- European BEV market share passed 15 percent of new sales in 2023.) Tj
T* (- North American adoption lags Europe by roughly two years.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Outlook) Tj
T* (Analysts project continued double-digit growth through 2026, constrained) Tj
T* (mainly by charging-infrastructure rollout and battery-material supply.) Tj
